# <<< claude (managed) <<<

# Durable concept-bridge stores: submissions, progress journals and pasted
# screenshots. Never committed — disposed of by /auto-concept Step 6a.
# Kept local in this repo (currently empty).
.claude/settings.json
# Regenerated by ship_build on every ship.
.claude/project-map.md
.claude/devops-concept/
# .claude/skills holds per-project extensions; this repo tracks only its own
# ship extension and its UI-rules override for the plugin's own surfaces (it is
# the plugin-source repo — it dogfoods the mechanism).
.claude/skills/*
!.claude/skills/do-ship/
!.claude/skills/auto-polish/
!.claude/skills/do-run/

